229	     * ({@code Sydney->NSW}, {@code Melbourne->VIC}, {@code Brisbane->QLD}), or
230	     * {@code "UNKNOWN"} when the city is not in the table. The single source of truth
231	     * for the city-to-region mapping, shared by {@link #getLocality()} and postcode
232	     * validation.
